{"pull": {"id": "number:22277", "number": 22277, "title": "MINOR: Fix race in StreamsGroupHeartbeatRequestTest testDynamicGroupConfig", "state": "closed", "draft": false, "created_at": "2026-05-13T10:46:07Z", "closed_at": "2026-05-14T04:19:10Z", "merged_at": "2026-05-14T04:19:10Z", "user": {"login": "squah-confluent", "id": 163298686, "node_id": "U_kgDOCbu9fg", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/163298686?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent", "html_url": "https://github.com/squah-confluent", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/squah-confluent/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "In testDynamicGroupConfig, we dynamically configure a group's\nstreams.num.standby.replicas, followed by\nstreams.task.offset.interval.ms. We then wait for the next assignment\nand check that it has the expected number of standby replicas and\nexpected task offset interval. However, this only guarantees that the\nnew streams.num.standby.replicas config has propagated to the group\ncoordinator and not necessarily the new task offset interval.\n\nAdd a loop to heartbeat until we observe the expected task offset\ninterval or a timeout elapses.\n\nReviewers: Lucas Brutschy <lbrutschy@confluent.io>, Matthias J. Sax\n <matthias@confluent.io>\n", "l